it happen to everyone before you. Pablo,

267
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:21,440
Carlos, Miguel, all ended the same way.

268
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:23,240
Either dead or in prison. None of them

269
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:25,040
made it out. You tell yourself you're

270
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:27,120
different, that you're smarter, that

271
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:29,600
you're careful. But late at night, when

272
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:31,520
the compound is quiet, you wonder, how

273
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:34,200
does this end? You've got money hidden

274
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:36,240
everywhere. Legitimate businesses. Exit

275
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:38,560
plans in five countries. But you know

276
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:40,520
you're not leaving. This is who you are.

277
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:42,200
You built an empire from nothing, from

278
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:44,560
poverty and violence and hunger for

279
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:46,360
something more. You climbed every rank.

280
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:48,560
You earned every scar. You remember

281
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:50,480
being a campanero once, just hidden in a

282
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:53,400
corner with the phone, watching,

283
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:54,880
waiting, surviving. But look at you now.

284
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:57,240
You run everything. You control

285
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:59,800
everyone. You're untouchable until

286
00:09:57,240 --> 00:10:02,440
you're not. This is the Colombian

287
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:02,440
Cartel.

